{{!
    @template local_oksigeniaaty/mobile_home_work

    «Your work» on the app's home (local\yourwork), for whoever runs something: under its heading, the first things
    waiting to be sorted out, the urgent first (six at most), then a line that says how many more there are and opens the
    whole panel, with the edge of danger when urgent ones are among them; and a door into each service, two in a row. Its
    «See all» opens the whole panel, only when that has more: more things waiting, or the services' shortcuts.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    With one door only and something waiting (single), the list and the door would say the same thing twice: the door
    opens instead, its head into the service and its lines inside it, each into its own thing; the rest, in «See all».

    Context variables required for this template:
    * work - heading, seeall, hasmore, hasshown, shown (mobile_work_alert), morelabel and moreurgent (the line to the
      rest), doors (mobile_work_door), single (one door, opened) and short (true: the doors' lines in whole parts); none
      when the person runs nothing.

    Example context (json):
    {}
}}
{{#work}}
<div class="aty-seccion-cab">
    <h2 class="aty-section">{{heading}}</h2>
    {{#hasmore}}<button type="button" class="aty-ver" core-site-plugins-new-content component="local_oksigeniaaty" method="mobile_work" title="{{heading}}" [args]="{}">{{seeall}}</button>{{/hasmore}}
</div>
{{#single}}
{{#doors}}
<div class="aty-puerta-abierta{{#urgent}} aty-urgent{{/urgent}}">
    <a class="aty-puerta-abierta-cab" core-link href="{{url}}" capture="false"{{^browser}} inApp="true"{{/browser}}>
        <span class="aty-servicio-logo">{{#icon}}<img src="{{icon}}" alt="">{{/icon}}</span>
        <span class="aty-puerta-nombre">{{title}}</span>
        <ion-icon name="fas-chevron-right" aria-hidden="true"></ion-icon>
    </a>
    <div class="aty-puerta-abierta-avisos">
        {{#shown}}
        <a class="aty-puerta-abierta-aviso{{#urgent}} aty-urgent{{/urgent}}" core-link href="{{url}}" capture="false"{{^browser}} inApp="true"{{/browser}}>
            <span class="aty-puerta-abierta-punto"></span>
            <span class="aty-event-name">{{#urgent}}<span class="sr-only">{{#str}} yourwork:urgent, local_oksigeniaaty {{/str}} </span>{{/urgent}}{{text}}</span>
            <ion-icon name="fas-chevron-right" aria-hidden="true"></ion-icon>
        </a>
        {{/shown}}
    </div>
</div>
{{/doors}}
{{/single}}
{{^single}}
{{#hasshown}}
<div class="aty-agenda">
    {{#shown}}
    {{> local_oksigeniaaty/mobile_work_alert }}
    {{/shown}}
    {{#morelabel}}
    <button type="button" class="aty-event aty-aviso aty-mas{{#moreurgent}} aty-urgent{{/moreurgent}}" core-site-plugins-new-content component="local_oksigeniaaty" method="mobile_work" title="{{heading}}" [args]="{}">
        <span class="aty-event-body"><span class="aty-event-name">{{#moreurgent}}<span class="sr-only">{{#str}} yourwork:urgent, local_oksigeniaaty {{/str}} </span>{{/moreurgent}}{{morelabel}}</span></span>
        <ion-icon name="fas-chevron-right" aria-hidden="true"></ion-icon>
    </button>
    {{/morelabel}}
</div>
{{/hasshown}}
<div class="aty-puertas">
    {{#doors}}
    {{> local_oksigeniaaty/mobile_work_door }}
    {{/doors}}
</div>
{{/single}}
{{/work}}
